<!--
  "Close all" affordance, matched to Samsung Grace UX. Measured from a stock SM-A310F
  (.ichthys-reference/recents/graceux_a310f_stack.png, 720x1280 @ 2.0 px/dp): 398x68px = 199x34dp.

  The shape is the part that reads as "Grace UX": it is a near-rectangle with only a slight corner
  softening (~8px = 4dp), not a capsule — an earlier pass rounded it to half its height and that
  single change was what made it stop matching the reference. It is also translucent rather than
  filled, so the wallpaper shows through, and carries a light hairline outline that separates it
  from a dark backdrop.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <solid android:color="#8C10101C" />
    <corners android:radius="4dp" />
    <stroke
        android:width="1dp"
        android:color="#59FFFFFF" />
</shape>
